        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Presented by Global Dance Services The event wrap up finale of VERT-I-Go Dance Experience. Featuring routines submitted for Most Entertaining and Most Improved. Pre-order your refreshments here!&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
      }
