    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Staring Blythe Danner and Sam Elliot. In this vibrant, funny, and heartfelt film, a widow and former songstress discovers that life can begin anew at any age. With the support of three loyal girlfriends, Carol decides to embrace the world, embarking on an unlikely friendship with her pool maintenance man, pursuing a new love interest, […]"
