    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Universo Tour Vancouver   Chino & Nacho is a Venezuelan pop duo, consisting of Jesús Alberto Miranda Pérez (Chino) (born November 15, 1984) and Miguel Ignacio Mendoza (Nacho) (born August 22, 1977). In 2010, the group won a Latin Grammy for Best Urban Album for Mi Niña Bonita. The group had musical genres, though most reggaeton, […]"
      }
