    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Sheila was raised in Vancouver. She obtained her B.Ed. from U.B.C. . Childhood experiences in Howe Sound in the 1950’s led to  a life long connection with the forest and the sea. In this series of paintings I would like to draw attention to the importance and complexity of the natural world beneath our feet.  […]"
      }
