        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Langley Ukulele Ensemble Langley Ukulele Ensemble directed by Paul Luongo featuring music from traditional carols to the themes of bells, seasonal characters and holiday favourites. Promising a fun, enjoyable, entertaining and inspiring performance, the LUE invites you to take in the Christmas festivities this December. Performed by the Langley School District 35. The LUE is […]"
