        "@value": "The Brothers Landreth, known individually as David Landreth, his brother Joey Landreth and longtime friends and bandmates Ariel Posen and Ryan “Rhino”, are the rising stars in the folk and roots music scene. The Brothers Landreth specialize in love gone bad and cowboy lullabies. Riding high after winning their first Juno Award when their album […]"
