        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Xtreme Promotions presents the 2nd Annual “LEIGH BRANDT MUSCLE CLASSIC” Held on Saturday March 19th-2016 with Morning Pre-judging starting at 9am & Evening Finals at 6pm  Sanctioned by the BCABBA  This Event is a Provincial Qualifier and will also Feature the New Mens “Classic Physique Class”  Along with Bodybuilding, Fitness,Figure , physique & Bikini.  Promoters: […]"
