    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Originally from Estonia, via Sweden, Enda Bardell is a Canadian Artist living and working in Vancouver, exploring an abundance of subject matter in the area of which she lives. OUT & ABOUT is a collection of watercolour paintings painted either outdoors on location, or from reference photos of inspirational locations around the Lower Mainland and […]"
