        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "The Maple Leaf Singers - Movie Magic | Massey Theatre"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Movies transport us, give us moments that stays with us, often wrapped in music. Rediscover those moments at Movie Magic, the Maple Leaf Singers’ musical journey through films that warm hearts, inspire minds, and bring laughter… or sometimes tears. On May 28 and 29 remember the stories that go with the words and rhythms of […]"
      }
