        "@value": "REVEEN:The Next Generation | Massey Theatre"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "He was known to millions simply as “Reveen”… But Ty Reveen has always just called him Dad. And now, this next-generation magician and hypnotist is following in his famous father’s footsteps… continuing the family tradition with a new “super-subconscious journey” into the marvels of the mind… Reveen: The Next Generation. People of a certain age […]"
      }
    ],
