    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Christy was born and raised in northern BC. She moved to London UK at the age of twenty and traveled extensively through Europe, India, Asia, Mexico, Australia and the Middle East. A former bicycle messenger in Vancouver, London and Melbourne Christy studied at Langara College and is a graduate from Emily Carr University. Artist Statement: […]"
