      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "The Vancity Showdown will be the traditional fitness, figure, bikini, physique, and bodybuilding show of the year that will highlight the best in tier 1 regional level athletes. On October 15th, 2016 we will be taking over the Massey Theatre in New Westminster, BC to bring you a spectacular showcase of hard work & dedication […]"
