    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Raised in New Westminster, Jack was a painter and graphic designer. He graduated with Honour from the Vancouver School of Art (Emily Carr Institute of Art and Design). Jack Campbell taught drawing and painting workshops for the Emily Carr Institute of Art and Design and was a full time teacher at the Kootenay School of […]"
