        "@value": "In 1930s Ireland, political activist Jimmy Gralton (Barry Ward) faces deportation for running a community hall for the arts. Initial release: May 30, 2014 (United Kingdom) Director: Ken Loach Screenplay: Paul Laverty Story by: Donal O’Kelly Adults $10.  Senior/Student $8 (Seniors 65 and over)"
