        "@value": "Struggling to build relationships with others, a teenage math prodigy (Asa Butterfield) develops a budding friendship with a young girl (Jo Yang) while competing at the International Mathematics Olympiad. Screenplay: James Graham Music composed by: Martin Phipps Adults $10.  Senior/Student $8 (Seniors 65 and over)"
