    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "May 15th, 2016 9:00AM This years TedxKids@BC theme is Regenerate. Regenerate /rəˈjenəˌrāt/ verb: bring into renewed existence; generate again. bring new and more vigorous life to, revive. cause to be reborn again or reproduced, reborn. synonyms: revive, revitalize, renew, restore, breathe new life into, revitalize, rejuvenate, re-energize, reanimate, resuscitate, invigorate, refresh Every year, youth of […]"
      }
