        "@value": "WHO: BC’s top magicians and variety artists (scroll down for performer info). WHAT: One-time only family-friendly benefit show on behalf of those families in Fort McMurray that have lost their homes in this devastating tragedy. WHY: So many young families have been affected by this disaster. As family entertainers, many of us have performed multiple times in Fort […]"
