      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "éveil – directly translated from French as “Awakening” or “Arousal” Many years ago, I read “the Celestine Prophecy” and James Redfield seconded my belief that perception of the invisible universal energy that unites all things starts with an increased awareness of beauty. Places, creatures, and objects that have a high level of that energy appear […]"
      }
    ],
