      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "CLASS OF ‘59 features the early years of Rock’n’Roll… Imagine the band with Buddy Holly on guitar … Jerry Lee Lewis on piano… The Big Bopper on string bass… plus special guests… Young Elvis… The Everly Brothers… Bill Haley… Jackie Wilson and Sam Cook plus “Mr Sax” Johnny Ferreira and more!  It’s a fabulous “oldies” […]"
      }
    ],
