    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "MOMENTUM Youth Arts Movement is back again for it’s fourth year in New Westminster! Friday October 14 – Massey Theatre 5:00PM-6:00PM: Cheondoong Korean Drumming: Drumming Workshop 7:00PM-8:30PM: Indie Band Performance: Smash Boom Pow (with guest Julien Amar) 8:30PM-9:00PM: “Art Rotate” Live Painting event with DJ Jordan Whittaker 9:00PM-10:00PM: Cheondoong Korean Drumming: Performance Saturday October 15 […]"
