        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "“Blow Me a Kiss” Award winning Vancouver Island based photographer Lisa Graham established Seadance Photography in 2009 and specializes in underwater portraits with an artistic flair. Her knowledge as a portrait photographer and her history as a dive instructor and underwater photographer create a unique skill-set that generates unique results. Lisa’s underwater portraits are described […]"
