      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Born in South Korea, Younghwa has spent her early life studying and practicing fine art as a student in Korea and Alberta, Canada. Her earlier years in Alberta were spent in the petroleum industry as a drafting technician, and she later worked for the University of British Columbia. Currently, she is a member of the […]"
