    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Artist and poet, Carla Stein began writing about the same time as she discovered crayons and tempera. She remains fascinated by the images words evoke, and finds her poetic endeavors often cross fertilize her visual compositions.  Growing up in a family of creative individuals she was exposed to viewing and making art at an early […]"
      }
