    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "The Laurentien Collection by David Pacholko The Plaskett Gallery is open 1 to 5pm Tuesday to Saturday and 1 hour before Massey Theatre performances. David Pacholko, Artist Statement For me, painting is an intimate and private experience I embark upon each time I face a canvas. I re-visit past and present life experiences and allow […]"
