        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Adults $31, Sen/Students 13 and over $16 plus service charges.&lt;/p&gt;\\n&lt;p&gt;Senior age 65. Children 12 and under are free but tickets are required - PLEASE CALL THE BOX OFFICE - 604 521 5050 for child tickets as they are not available online. &lt;/p&gt;\\n&lt;p&gt;Buy 4 tickets and get one free - PLEASE CALL THE BOX OFFICE FOR THIS OFFER&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
