        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "New Westminster Secondary School Dance Department presents ‘The Fated Five’ and Dance Evolution” Thursday Jan 11 at 7pm. Tickets $6.00 plus service charges. This year’s semester end dance shows promise to be thrilling, chilling and an enjoyable experience all around! The senior dance students present “The Fated Five”, a show about a group of teenagers […]"
