        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Fated Five and Dance Evolution"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;New Westminster Secondary School Dance Department presents ‘The Fated Five’ and Dance Evolution” Thursday Jan 11 at 7pm. Tickets $6.00 plus service charges. This year\\'s semester end dance shows promise to be thrilling, chilling and an enjoyable experience all around! The senior dance students present &quot;The Fated Five&quot;, a show about a group of teenagers &lt;/p&gt;\\n"
      }
    ]
  },
