        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "RUMBLE: THE INDIANS WHO ROCKED THE WORLD | Massey Theatre"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "This powerful documentary about the role of Native Americans in contemporary music history-featuring some of the greatest music stars of our time-exposes a critical missing chapter, revealing how indigenous musicians helped shape the soundtracks of our lives and, through their contributions, influenced popular culture. Tickets Adults $9. Sen/Students $8"
      }
