      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Jan 13             Public Reading of White Noise by Taran Kootenhayoo – 7pm, Plaskett Gallery White Noise is a comedy on racial commentary – an effort to dissect the micro and macro nuance of racism that exists within Canada, particularly between indigenous and non-indigenous folks.  The hope is to explore the layered racism through comedy that […]"
      }
