        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Jan 18                   FREE EVENT Family Pow Wow Dance Class with Shyama Priya - 3:30pm Feast at 4pm by Bigheart Bannock Artlatch - 5pm in Massey Theatre With Ronnie Dean Harris Kevin Loring Coastal Wolf Pack Brandon Gabriel DJ Kookum Valeen Jules Jaz Scuff Sam Bob and Sandy &lt;/p&gt;\\n"
