        "@value": "Cabaret | Massey Theatre"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Royal City Musical Theatre is presenting the Tony Award winning musical Cabaret by Kander and Ebb, April 12 – 29, 2018.  Since opening in 1966 the show remains a devastatingly relevant work of art and continues to be both entertaining and unsettling. Set in 1931 Berlin in the seedy glamour of the Kit Kat Klub, its bawdy emcee […]"
      }
    ],
