        "@value": "O Christmas Tea: A British Comedy"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Fans of Monty Python, Mr. Bean, and Dr. Seuss… Grab your teacups! Following the smashing success of their 2017 Canadian comedy tour, London’s 3-time IMPRESARIO award-winning comedians James &amp; Jamesy return with their outrageously funny and brilliantly inventive Christmas comedy O Christmas Tea. When catastrophe strikes at James and Jamesy’s Christmas tea party, flooding the &lt;/p&gt;\\n"
      }
    ]
