    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Quayside Voices, with support from the Massey Theatre Society and New Westminster Secondary School, is pleased to present The Real Group! The Real Group is a professional a cappella ensemble from Sweden, in constant development since its formation in 1984. The Real Group is one of the leading forces in the world of vocal music […]"
