    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Moon Coin Productions presents ABRA Cadabra – A Tribute to Abba ‘ABRA Cadabra’ from Vancouver, Canada has been touring the world for over 18 years, helping audiences of all ages and cultures to re-live and celebrate the timeless and uplifting music of ABBA! Featuring a full live band, dancers, powerful vocals and costumes, this high-energy […]"
