        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Going with the Flow- Susie Gilmour | Massey Theatre"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "A native of Scotland, Susie Gilmour now lives on a float home on the beautiful Fraser River in BC. Not a day goes by without her thanking the river for its tranquility, inspiration and magical sunsets. With a career in theatre arts she has recently renewed her passion for painting and is currently working with […]"
      }
