      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "The New Westminster Symphony Orchestra and Royal City Musical Theatre Presents Kismet in Concert Style. This is the first time these incredible organizations have collaborated on a presentation (and hopefully not the last), and it’s sure to be magical. About Kismet With three Tony Awards (including Best Musical), a television version and an MGM smash film, Kismet […]"
