        "@value": "Get a Clue & Welcome to the Magic Show | Massey Theatre"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "The NWSS Dance Department introduces their end of semester Dance Show. The senior dancers present “Get A Clue,” a show loosely based on the popular whodunit board game “Clue”. Come join our high school students who have to solve the mystery, complete with hip hop, suspects and intrigue! The junior dancers present “Welcome to the […]"
      }
