    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "We welcome you to our PULSE community to enjoy an afternoon or evening of Dance.  Come and share our year end showcase with us!   Colour Your World, June 22, 2019 1:00pm General admission $15 plus services charge Student admission $12 plus services charge   Explore, June 22, 2019 5:00pm General admission $22 plus service […]"
