        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Surfaces…Surfaces exploration and exploration in BC by Karen Colville Transparent  to opaque sets the mood and tone, use of materials and glazes with paints to an caustic, water colors, mixed mediums and fibers, allow myself to layer shape and imagery creating a sense of depth, “soulful” and  creative spirit of  life cycle textures of the &lt;/p&gt;\\n"
