      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Predictably GOOD FUN. Started in Tokyo in 2003 by Klein Dytham Architecture firm, PechaKucha Night began as a fun and unique night of local culture, entertainment and community building. Ten presenters from a range of fields share their interesting projects, inspirations and passions. The catch is, presenters get 20 images, 20 seconds each, making for […]"
