        "@value": "Rock.It Boy Entertainment presents BURTON CUMMINGS – UP CLOSE AND ALONE TOUR This is Burton Cummings; the voice; the songs of a generation.  The Music you know, from the man who created it. Burton Cummings’ musical creations continue to resonate with fans both old and new. With a voice considered to be one of the […]"
