      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Please note the date of this performance has changed due to weather conditions.   The time has come for yet another fantastic NWSS Dance Show! This semester, our senior dancers present “Super Mario: World Tour”. In this show, all your favourite Super Mario characters come to life in a thrilling dance adventure filled with heroes, […]"
