    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Please note the date of this performance has changed due to weather conditions. &nbsp; The time has come for yet another fantastic NWSS Dance Show! This semester, our senior dancers present &quot;Super Mario: World Tour&quot;. In this show, all your favourite Super Mario characters come to life in a thrilling dance adventure filled with heroes, &lt;/p&gt;\\n"
