    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Come to the Plaskett Gallery for an evening of true storytelling, music and art! This edition of The Flame will feature a few “Adult Content” stories, so expect some foul language and mature content. Storytellers Include: Noreen Murphy Jay Brazeau Melanie L. Walker Wong Wing-Siu Japhy Ryder Sterling James Marylee Stephenson Peter Jorgenson Katey Wright […]"
