    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Looking to get a quick arts fix after months of no in person events? Enjoy some art while apart with the Plaskett Limited Summer Residence program! For FREE! Book a 30 minute visit with your bubble to listen to some music and see some amazing art. Cassius Khan and Amika Kushwaha will be in residence &lt;/p&gt;\\n"
