    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Our next artist in our series of weeklong artist residencies as part of our Plasket Limited program is Tomoyo Yamada Dancers.  Tomoyo Yamada Dancers will be performing Thursday August 20th and Friday August 21st from 1-4 and Saturday August 22nd from 5-7. Book a 30 minute time slot ONLINE to experience art and dance in &lt;/p&gt;\\n"
