    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Breaking Lessons and Sessions with Josh Cameron Tuesdays from 5pm – 7pm Until June 15th FREE Online A learning and development space prioritizing BIPOC youth under 21 in New Westminster with breaking experience. This program is a weekly, in person drop in consisting of two main components. The first hour will be a formal lesson […]"
