    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Breaking Lessons and Sessions with Josh Cameron Tuesdays from 5pm - 7pm Until June 15th FREE Online A learning and development space prioritizing BIPOC youth under 21 in New Westminster with breaking experience. This program is a weekly, in person drop in consisting of two main components. The first hour will be a formal lesson &lt;/p&gt;\\n"
