    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;The second performance of Open Space Saturdays features Coldwater Road and Norine Braun Coldwater Road Lyrically rich with steady drive, Coldwater Road gives storytelling a reason to move. Swinging between love songs and foot-stomping murder ballads, CwRoad covers a lot of ground; their songs often rooted in Canadian History and the Western Frontier. Their style reaches &lt;/p&gt;\\n"
      }
    ]
