        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "10th Annual Mushtari Begum Festival | Massey Theatre"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "We are excited to present Canada’s Premiere Indian Classical Music and Dance event, the 10th Anniversary Mushtari Begum Festival of Indian Classical Music and Dance. The MBF features the Ghazal/Tabla artiste Cassius Khan, Harmonium maestra Amika Kushwaha  and Violin Maestro Kaushik Sivaramakrishnan where Cassius Khan will present a tribute of choice classical ghazals and Tabla. […]"
      }
    ],
