        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;By Michael P. Northey A Green Thumb Theatre Production Livestream ‍Stan, a.k.a. “Definition” is a rising freestyle MC – or at least he was, until his life’s passion lost out to his drug habit. Now on the road to recovery and preparing for a come-back show, Stan confronts his demons and recounts his harrowing journey &lt;/p&gt;\\n"
