        "@value": "It’s the most wonderful time of the year and pantomimes are back to make you laugh, cheer and boo! Written by Crystal Weltzin, the classic story of _Alice in Wonderland_ is adapted to the well known standards of laughter and entertainment inherently required by a true PANTO. With original music, new characters and some of […]"
