    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Rising out of the ashes of psychedelia in 1969, Canada’s legendary Chilliwack released 12 albums over a 15 year period producing numerous Canadian and international hits including “Lonesome Mary”, “Fly At Night”, &amp; “California Girl” in the 70’s; and “My Girl (gone gone gone)”, “Whatcha Gonna Do” in the 80’s. All this work led to &lt;/p&gt;\\n"
      }
    ]
