        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Proudly sponsored by Piva Modern Italian Restaurant Show program can be viewed and downladed HERE The pre-pandemic hit show produced by Arts Club Theatre Company is being remounted on the Massey Stage. Noises Off, hailed as the funniest farce ever written, treats audiences to a hilarious peek at a second-tier acting troupe performing a show. &lt;/p&gt;\\n"
      }
    ]
  },
