    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Chicago-based rockers The Lovettes celebrate the great girl groups from the golden era of pop in their own show “Leaders Of The Pack ”as seen on PBS’ Doo-Wop Generations. This talented trio’s upbeat retrospective of the 40s, 50s, and 60s is jam packed with harmony, dance, and good times. Putting their own twist on icons […]"
