    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Artist Statement for Walk in Beauty To Walk in Beauty means to walk in harmony with all things in your life and especially nature. Explore your inner peace, close your eyes and breathe in the perfume of florals or step into a landscape and go for a walk.  Feel the essence of beauty and let &lt;/p&gt;\\n"
