        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "June 4 at 2:00 and 6:00 pm Finale 2022 is Tri-City Dance Centre’s annual recital showcasing its students ages 3-18 in ballet, tap, jazz, lyrical, musical theatre, acrobatics and contemporary. Expect a fast moving, fun show featuring our young dancers from beginners to pre professionals!  "
