        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "NWSS June Revue Concert and Awards | Massey Theatre"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "It’s been two years since the New Westminster Secondary Music Department ensembles have been able to celebrate the end-of-the-year with the traditional June Revue Concert and Awards. But this year, they are back!! This concert has been a tradition at NWSS for decades, and students and staff are thrilled to be bringing the music back […]"
      }
