        "@value": "Larry Tillyer was born in Victoria, B.C. and moved with his family to Vancouver when he was a small boy. Larry is a self taught artist who began his odyssey of painting in 1987. Larry started painting after a successful career in music playing with the likes of Bill Haley & The Comets, Ivory Joe […]"
