        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;PRESENTED BY MODO LIVE Irish singer and entertainer, Daniel O’Donnell is coming to New Westminster at Massey Theatre on September 23rd, 2022. The Donegal based singer, who is one of the most prolific and successful recording artists in the UK charts, is the only artist in the world to score a hit in the UK &lt;/p&gt;\\n"
