        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;PRESENTED BY WEST COAST EVENTS The Mawlid is celebrated by millions of people around the world. Join us in celebrating the birth of the best man to walk the face of the earth. The performance is led by Yahya Hawwa and Mustafa Al-Azzawi ! Tickets for Mawlid an-Nabi concert are available online and at the &lt;/p&gt;\\n"
