    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "MASSEY PRESENTS Tom Jackson-Stories Songs and Santa Causes Tom Jackson kickstarts the holiday season with grace, style, and quirky festivity that many have enjoyed for decades. Expect an evening of original music, sing-along tunes, and signature Christmas music from this master storyteller. Tom has travelled coast to coast to coast with The Huron Carole for […]"
      }
