    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "MASSEY PRESENTS A Dinosaur Tale A LIVE action fantasy adventure for the whole family. A mysterious time-warping wormhole has brought the dinosaurs back into our world and it’s up to Lisa and Declan, a pair of intrepid eighth graders,  to send the creatures home before the school field trip is over. In the tradition of […]"
