      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;The First Canadian Physique Alliance Show of the 2023 Season will take place March 25th at the Massey Theatre in New Westminster , BC This Level 1 amateur show is open to all competitors across Canada in the following classes;  Bodybuilding, Classic Physique, Physique, Figure, Bikini, Fitness &amp; Wellness Categories. This event is promoted by &lt;/p&gt;\\n"
