    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "This exhibition occurs in conjunction with a workshop in the Massey artist studios, and showcases six artists who share a similar process in creating mixed media art. They work on canvas and cradled panels using paper, paint, and other materials. The artists met at a workshop where they discovered new methods of working with discarded […]"
