        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;EVENT CANCELLED Due to circumstances beyond our control, the upcoming performance of Tamikrest on May 26 has been cancelled.  Please consider exchanging your tickets to a performance in our 2023-24 season.  The line up can be found here: https://www.masseytheatre.com/announcing-our-2023-2024-season/ If you would prefer a refund, please let us know and we will complete that by &lt;/p&gt;\\n"
