    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Founded in 2013 by Carrie Tennant, the Vancouver Youth Choir (VYC) has quickly emerged as one of the most active and highly regarded youth choirs in Canada. In nine years, the organization has expanded to include more than 320 singers in 7 ensembles, including the brand-new “VYC Kindred” - a free choral program where immigrant &lt;/p&gt;\\n"
