        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Join us for an electrifying evening as the Kerala Cultural Association of British Columbia (KCABC) proudly presents THAIKKUDAM BRIDGE LIVE IN VANCOUVER! 🎵🎉 Experience the mesmerizing music of the renowned Thaikkudam Bridge, straight from Kerala, right here in Vancouver.  Don\\'t miss this incredible opportunity to be part of a memorable musical journey. Get ready to &lt;/p&gt;\\n"
