        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Awarded numerous awards (JUNO, CFMA…), Oktopus is a major presence on the Canadian world music scene, with over 250 performances to its credit at home and abroad. The group is primarily devoted to klezmer distinguished by a novel approach that incorporates various components of the classical and Québécois repertoire, with some jazz and Balkan accents. […]"
