        "@value": "Buddy&#8217;s Holly Jolly Christmas 2023"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;PRESENTED BY LEGENDS OF ROCK N ROLL Zachary Stevenson is the leading man from the hit musical “The Buddy Holly Story”… he is the main attraction and host for this special Christmas concert… Buddy’s Holly Jolly Christmas. Stevenson will be joined by the Chicago-based trio The Lovettes with their show-stopping salute to the female icons &lt;/p&gt;\\n"
      }
    ]
