        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Presented by Xtreme Promotions This years event is set to take centre stage on Sunday, Nov 12th at the Massey theatre in New Westminster. This high-energy event will bring together the finest athletes from across Canada to display their dedication, discipline, and sculpted physiques. With its reputation as a premier event, the Vancouver Fall Classic &lt;/p&gt;\\n"
