        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Photographer Amie Le Blanc and multidisciplinary artist Keith Randall present an exhibition delving into the profound connection to land and the nuanced sense of belonging. Amie’s authentic vision captures shared joy in appreciating nature’s fleeting moments, while Keith’s layered artworks, influenced by Post Minimalism and Pop Art, explore the complex interplay of human behavior across &lt;/p&gt;\\n"
      }
    ]
  },
