      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "PRESENTED BY MASSEY THEATRE For the first time ever, Anne of Green Gables has been created as a full-length ballet! With musical arrangements from Anne of Green Gables – The Musical, this production will bring to life Canada’s favourite Prince Edward Islander.   The audience will follow Anne’s adventures as she explores the fictional town […]"
