    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Artist Statement: The photographers in our club are always looking for ways to strengthen their storytelling, and their ability to take the viewer into the story they are creating with their image. “Framing” is a powerful technique for guiding the eye of the viewer. Framing can help the draw the viewer into the image. It &lt;/p&gt;\\n"
