    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Presented by Global Dance Services VERT-I-Go Dance Experience: Welcome to our Zero Waste, Pre-season Dance Event – A dance festival for the whole dancer, featuring injury prevention, mental health workshops and movement activities. In lieu of medals and trophies a donation has been made to the World Wildlife Federation animal conservation efforts. Pre-order your refreshments […]"
