        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Ticket Prices: Child Under 5: $5.25 (plus service charges) Child All Day Pass: $15.76 (plus service charges) General Admission: $10.50 (plus service charges) All Day Pass: $31.50 (plus service charges) BUY TICKETS Pre-order your refreshments for pre-show and intermission here! &nbsp; Presented by Evolve Dance The Provincial DanceDown The highest scoring routines from our regional &lt;/p&gt;\\n"
