    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "PRESENTED BY EIGHTH & EIGHT CREATIVE SPACES The always engaging and magnanimous musician and host Cassius Khan and a variety of highly accomplished musicians and tea specialists take the audience on a musical journey around the world, bringing you connection to generations past through songs and experiences that have endured for thousands of years. On […]"
