        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Ticket prices: Student: $21 (plus s/c) Senior: $24 (plus s/c) Adult: $27 (plus s/c) BUY TICKETS Pre-order your refreshments for pre-show and intermission here! &nbsp; The Flair of Fred Astaire Presented by Eighth &amp; Eight Creative Spaces FRED ASTAIRE—the greatest of all movie dancers—takes the spotlight in this show presented by classic film scholar MICHAEL &lt;/p&gt;\\n"
