    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Ticket prices: General Admission: $22.99 (plus s/c) As per safety regulations, EVERY audience member requires a seat. If you have a baby 2yrs and under, you can select them a complimentary ticket so they may attend with you free of charge. BUY TICKETS Pre-order your refreshments for pre-show! &nbsp; Presented by Lights Up Musical Theatre &lt;/p&gt;\\n"
      }
    ]
