    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Ticket Price: $14 (plus s/c) Running Time: 70 minutes, no intermission Content Warnings: mild flashing lights, use of fog machine, loud music and cheering BUY TICKETS &nbsp; Presented by the New Westminster Secondary School Dance Department What happens when your feelings take centre stage? As Riley braces for the biggest moment of her dance career, &lt;/p&gt;\\n"
