        "@value": "DanceForce. studio Company Showcase | Massey Theatre"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "DanceForce. studio invites you to join them for their Recital Showcase.  Celebrate the talented dancers from DanceForce. as they perform many of their award winning routines from their 2024/25 season.  The Showcase will feature dancers from 2-18yrs of age in a multitude of  dance disciplines: Jazz, Ballet, Musical Theatre, Contemporary, Acrobatics, Lyrical, Hip Hop & […]"
      }
    ],
